WEBVTT

00:00.260 --> 00:01.490
Hello, I'm Dr.

00:01.660 --> 00:02.820
Melva Wallace.

00:03.120 --> 00:04.270
This message was made

00:04.440 --> 00:06.000
with my digital twin.

00:06.320 --> 00:07.760
I can't be in every

00:07.890 --> 00:09.660
room, every church,

00:09.940 --> 00:11.580
every campus event.

00:11.950 --> 00:13.140
But I can still show up

00:13.310 --> 00:14.420
with a word of welcome,

00:14.680 --> 00:15.910
a thank you, and some

00:15.960 --> 00:16.850
encouragement.

00:17.110 --> 00:18.860
Every message is

00:18.990 --> 00:20.950
approved by me before it

00:20.990 --> 00:21.740
goes out.

00:22.100 --> 00:23.170
That's how I stay

00:23.250 --> 00:24.320
present for the people I

00:24.360 --> 00:25.560
serve, even when my

00:25.600 --> 00:27.760
calendar says I can't.
